To return the **Novation Launchpad X** from Programmer Mode to its normal standalone Note Mode, send a SysEx command that switches the device back to **Note Mode**.

Your current command:

```
F0 00 20 29 02 0C 0E 01 F7
```

uses `0E 01` to select Programmer Mode.

The important part is changing the mode byte to `00`:

```
void sendLaunchpadNoteMode()
{
    static const uint8_t kNoteModeSysex[] =
    {
        0xF0,
        0x00,
        0x20,
        0x29,
        0x02,
        0x0C,
        0x0E,
        0x00,
        0xF7
    };

    launchpad.sendSysEx(
        sizeof(kNoteModeSysex),
        kNoteModeSysex,
        true);

    resetLaunchpadLedCache();
}
```

According to Novation's documentation, Live Mode automatically selects Note Mode when the Launchpad is not in DAW mode.&#x20;

[image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://userguides.novationmusic.com\&sz=32)

Novation User Guides+1



**If you want to explicitly select Scale Mode as well**, you can send this additional SysEx command:

```
void sendLaunchpadScaleMode()
{
    static const uint8_t sysex[] = {
        0xF0, 0x00, 0x20, 0x29,
        0x02, 0x0C, 0x15, 0x01,
        0xF7
    };

    launchpad.sendSysEx(sizeof(sysex), sysex, true);
}
```

The relevant commands are:

| Command | Purpose            |
| ------- | ------------------ |
| `0E 00` | Live Mode          |
| `0E 01` | Programmer Mode    |
| `00 01` | Select Note layout |
| `15 00` | Chromatic Mode     |
| `15 01` | Scale Mode         |

**My recommendation for your Teensy sequencer:**

Use this sequence when returning to normal playing:

1. Send `0E 00` – Live Mode.
2. Send `00 01` – Note layout.
3. Send `15 01` – Scale Mode (if desired).
4. Reset your LED cache.

This way you can switch between your custom Teensy-controlled pad interface and the Launchpad's native playing interface without disconnecting USB.

Reference: [Novation Launchpad X Configuration Messages](https://userguides.novationmusic.com/hc/en-gb/articles/24001463447826-Launchpad-X-configuration-messages?utm_source=chatgpt.com).